OL,3,GNEWSAInner city school turns playground
OL,4,Ainto nature area
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren at a primary school in inner
OL,7,Fcity Bradford have been remodelling
OL,8,Ftheir grey asphalt playground into a
OL,9,Fnature haven.
OL,11,FLapage Primary School in Barkerend is
OL,12,Fone of 10 schools to receive #25,000 as
OL,13,Fpart of a programme to tackle unequal
OL,14,Faccess to nature in schools.
OL,16,FHeadteacher Richard Grogan said the
OL,17,Fchildren had a key role in deciding how
OL,18,Fthe playground would be transformed.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
