OL,3,GNEWSAInner city school turns playground
OL,4,Ainto nature area
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is bespoke to us but we've taken
OL,7,Fthe idea from the children. So they've
OL,8,Fhad direct input to this, which we feel
OL,9,Fis really important because they need
OL,10,Fto own that space to be able to engage
OL,11,Fand want to engage with it," he said.
